2: 
3: This plan details installing CockroachDB natively on your local WSL instance (`antigravity-server`) and configuring it to join the mesh cluster containing nodes `0.mh`, `39.mh`, `38.mh`, `201.mh`, `antigravity-server`, and `aurora R0` for full data redundancy and local replication.
4: 
