9: >   `--join=0.mh:26257,39.mh:26257,38.mh:26257,201.mh:26257,antigravity-server:26257,aurora-r0:26257`
10: > - **Host Resolution**: This setup assumes these domains resolve correctly via your local DNS or `/etc/hosts` configuration.
11: > - **Insecure Mode**: It will start in `--insecure` mode to match the existing server deployment configuration.
12: 
